    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5ae917bb-6ff4-55a6-a251-ebbf1ce30fdb" activityNameId="8735791c-7f41-5b08-8699-546e1e219f06" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Platform, crude oil, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Platform, crude oil, offshore
Construction and dismantling of an offshore production platform with a weight of 2500t. Life time 15 years.;
adb3bfb7-7eb5-31ca-b34d-fad5194d0c92
Materials for construction, energy use for erection. Land use and transformation. Disposal of the platform after use. Wells are not included and are considered separately. Manufacturing of facilities partly not included.
Location:  Type of platform used in the North Sea.
Technology: Mix of 80% steel and 20% concrete platforms.
Time period: Data for materials based on information from 1990. New data for energy and material uses during construction.
Production volume: In 1998 there were 263 production platforms in use in the North Sea.
Sampling: Publication in environmental reports and other literature.
Extrapolations: Applied on all offshore operations. There might be differences depending on depth of sea.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_adb3bfb7-7eb5-31ca-b34d-fad5194d0c92.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3320dcee-ac7b-51fa-8397-bc03eb397f03" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
